This licence covers the source code in this repository and nothing else.

Phantom Abyss is the property of its rights holders. This project ships no game
assets, no game code, and no captured game data: no temple layouts, no phantom
recordings, no player records. What it distributes is a program that talks to a
copy of the game you already own, and a file format that players can use to
share what they recorded themselves.
